{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Paintballers : MLPB 2025, the groundbreaking cross-platform video game meticulously designed by professional paintball players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the adrenaline-fueled action, realistic environments, and strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned enthusiast or a newcomer, Paintballers delivers an authentic and thrilling paintball experience like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paintballers : MLPB 2025 offers you : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online 5v5 matches in first person</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Speedball, woodball and other game formats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Training mode to learn the real fields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A realistic movement system with 100% editable controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic paintball physics (Velocity, bounces, accuracy, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- World ranking and stats system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Possibility to host your own games via listen and dedicated servers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A free to play experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be updated regulary with new content (fields, gears, equipments).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2706090?t=1769781898","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2706090?t=1769781898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706090/1869603882533daacc4141b70b3b1f1cce987dbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769781898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706090/1869603882533daacc4141b70b3b1f1cce987dbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769781898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description"